# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SAFETY FIRST — personal / immigration / financial documents must never ship.
#
# The source material for this site lives alongside passport scans, visas,
# I-94s, the full H-1B petition, LCA paperwork, a marriage certificate,
# spouse pay stubs, and academic transcripts. Only an explicit allowlist of
# assets is ever copied into public/media. These patterns are a second line of
# defence so that an accidental copy still cannot be committed.
# Do not relax these.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Passport/
H1-B/
h1-b/
Education/
*visa*
*Visa*
*VISA*
*passport*
*Passport*
*I-94*
*i-94*
*I-797*
*LCA*
*lca*
*transcript*
*Transcript*
*marksheet*
*Marksheet*
*mark sheet*
*pay stub*
*paystub*
*Pay Date*
*marriage*
*Marriage*
*petition*
*Beneficiary*
*.docx

# Allow the one PDF we intentionally publish
!public/resume.pdf

